1
00:00:00,106 --> 00:00:01,542
Seorang ibu menaruh bayinya di

2
00:00:01,562 --> 00:00:02,130
dalam peti,

3
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:04,141
lalu melepasnya ke sungai.

4
00:00:04,161 --> 00:00:05,240
Justru itulah cara bayinya

5
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:06,067
diselamatkan.

6
00:00:06,087 --> 00:00:07,367
Tafsir Ibnu Katsir

7
00:00:07,387 --> 00:00:08,435
menceritakan:

8
00:00:08,455 --> 00:00:09,735
Firaun memerintahkan bayi

9
00:00:09,755 --> 00:00:11,763
laki-laki Bani Israil dibunuh.

10
00:00:11,783 --> 00:00:13,064
Para bidan mendata setiap

11
00:00:13,084 --> 00:00:14,243
perempuan yang hamil.

12
00:00:14,263 --> 00:00:15,915
Tapi kehamilan ibu Musa tidak

13
00:00:15,935 --> 00:00:17,417
tampak, dan Musa lahir tepat

14
00:00:17,437 --> 00:00:18,150
di tahun itu.

15
00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:20,114
Surah Al-Qashash ayat tujuh:

16
00:00:20,134 --> 00:00:22,795
Kami ilhamkan kepada ibu Musa,

17
00:00:22,815 --> 00:00:23,963
susuilah dia.

18
00:00:23,983 --> 00:00:24,985
Jika engkau khawatir,

19
00:00:25,005 --> 00:00:26,453
hanyutkanlah ia ke sungai.

20
00:00:26,473 --> 00:00:27,320
Jangan takut,

21
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:28,182
jangan bersedih.

22
00:00:28,202 --> 00:00:29,265
Kami akan mengembalikannya

23
00:00:29,285 --> 00:00:29,920
kepadamu.

24
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:31,236
Ia meletakkan bayinya di dalam

25
00:00:31,256 --> 00:00:33,120
peti dan melepasnya ke sungai

26
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:33,682
Nil.

27
00:00:33,702 --> 00:00:35,214
Arus membawanya ke tepi,

28
00:00:35,234 --> 00:00:36,484
dan bayi itu dipungut oleh

29
00:00:36,504 --> 00:00:37,563
keluarga Firaun,

30
00:00:37,583 --> 00:00:38,920
rumah musuhnya sendiri.

31
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:40,685
Istri Firaun berkata:

32
00:00:40,705 --> 00:00:42,496
ia penyejuk mata bagiku dan

33
00:00:42,516 --> 00:00:44,013
bagimu, jangan kalian bunuh

34
00:00:44,033 --> 00:00:44,537
dia.

35
00:00:44,557 --> 00:00:45,621
Sementara itu,

36
00:00:45,641 --> 00:00:47,795
hati ibu Musa menjadi kosong.

37
00:00:47,815 --> 00:00:49,421
Ia hampir membuka rahasianya,

38
00:00:49,441 --> 00:00:50,318
seandainya Allah tidak

39
00:00:50,338 --> 00:00:51,734
meneguhkan hatinya.

40
00:00:51,754 --> 00:00:53,547
Ia berkata kepada putrinya:

41
00:00:53,567 --> 00:00:54,614
ikutilah dia.

42
00:00:54,634 --> 00:00:55,883
Kakak Musa memperhatikan dari

43
00:00:55,903 --> 00:00:56,722
jauh.

44
00:00:56,742 --> 00:00:59,245
Bayi itu menolak menyusu

45
00:00:59,265 --> 00:01:00,422
kepada setiap perempuan yang

46
00:01:00,442 --> 00:01:01,353
didatangkan.

47
00:01:01,373 --> 00:01:02,531
Kakaknya berkata:

48
00:01:02,551 --> 00:01:04,002
maukah aku tunjukkan keluarga

49
00:01:04,022 --> 00:01:05,268
yang akan memeliharanya?

50
00:01:05,288 --> 00:01:06,414
Maka Kami kembalikan dia

51
00:01:06,434 --> 00:01:07,417
kepada ibunya,

52
00:01:07,437 --> 00:01:08,682
agar senang hatinya,

53
00:01:08,702 --> 00:01:10,091
dan agar ia tahu janji Allah

54
00:01:10,111 --> 00:01:10,783
itu benar.

55
00:01:10,803 --> 00:01:12,192
Kadang bagian tersulit dari

56
00:01:12,212 --> 00:01:14,018
percaya adalah melepaskan.

57
00:01:14,038 --> 00:01:15,396
Pernahkah kamu harus melepas

58
00:01:15,416 --> 00:01:16,998
sesuatu agar ia selamat?

59
00:01:17,018 --> 00:01:18,587
Kisah dalam Al-Qur'an,

60
00:01:18,607 --> 00:01:19,905
bersama AUDIRA.

